### Proposed Architecture

```
User (TypeScript UI)
        ↓
   3 Primitives
        ↓
   Rust Steward (Èṣù Gatekeeper)
        ↓
   ┌─────────────────────┐
   │   Nex- Runtime      │ ← Graph execution, orchestration, spawning
