### Benefits of This Combination

- **Performance**: BikoDB (Rust) gives fast storage + vector search.
- **Expressiveness**: Nex- gives powerful graph-based agent programming.
- **Sovereignty**: Everything stays under Rust Steward control.
- **Scalability**: Supports single agent → swarm naturally.

